{"unit_id":"kerwin2046__dsh-pin-recall#feature-web-actions","repo":"kerwin2046/dsh-pin-recall","commit":"61817c21006f51bbdd6ab8dd252af56cac59b6e2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「Web 消息钉住与召回」在已完成的助手消息操作栏显示星标切换按钮和召回按钮。点击星标按消息 ID 保存或取消保存该回复，点击召回按钮将全部钉住内容送入后续模型轮次。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:54-97","src/client/PinActions.tsx:107-175"]}
